   "beatTail": [
    "d92 say: 🕯️ Wanjiru Kamau is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
    "d92 say: \"Wanjiru's gone.\" Felix looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Wanjiru.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.",
    "d92 say: The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Wei blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
    "d92 say: 🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"",
    "d92 say: 📖 The Codex turns a page: Wanjiru Kamau, 92 days. The mantle passes to Wei Chen.",
    "d92 say: 🪞 You wake up somebody else. Wei Chen, 31 — a Beekeeper. His hands know different work now: Soft Step, Animal Ken.",
    "d92 say: At the grave, Thabo, Felix speak for Wei — \"Wanjiru trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
    "d92 say: The link with Emberhold is broken (gambit). What was built over weeks comes apart in a sentence."
